  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T13:44:48.318228Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T14:04:17.139903Z",
  "totalBlocks": 12,
  "translatedBlocks": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "117f8986e2a35463",
      "translationZh": "如果你在本地运行模型，就知道这种痛苦：一切原本都好好的，直到一个长提示词让模型悄无声息地卡住，或者 GPU 内存不足，最后只剩下一个挂起的请求，没有任何输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5db766ba52a0ef77",
      "translationZh": "我开发 HybridInfer 正是为了解决这个问题。它是一个小型的、具备可靠性感知能力的路由器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4eedb2f022a99ac",
      "translationZh": "先把每个请求发送到你的本地模型（Ollama）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88da4e42a9654605",
      "translationZh": "监控运行情况，如果本地模型卡住（N 秒内没有生成任何 token）、内存不足或出错，就会在同一个请求中自动回退到远程模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "330308499239aaf1",
      "translationZh": "学习哪些提示词会让你的机器吃不消（通常是较长的提示词），在见过它们失败之后，以后就会提前将这类请求路由到远程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b33cfba4a48c4926",
      "translationZh": "将卡死的模型移出轮转列表，然后在冷却期结束后通过探测尝试将其重新加入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57d4563efe509353",
      "translationZh": "它是一个兼容 OpenAI 的服务器，所以只需将任何兼容 OpenAI 的客户端或应用指向它，就能直接获得本地优先 + 自动回退的能力。本地 = 你通过 ollama pull 拉取的任何模型；远程 = 任何兼容 OpenAI 的端点（OpenAI、OpenRouter、一台运行 vLLM 的机器，什么都行）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4db52fc22588688",
      "translationZh": "它是路由器，不是推理引擎；它负责协调 Ollama 和你的远程端点，本身不运行模型权重。目前是早期的 v0.1，采用 Apache-2.0 许可证。还有一个 Kotlin/Android 版本，用于设备端应用。仓库里有简短的演示 GIF 和代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "019fa6b00f46d85c",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/SimranKoul2026/HybridInfer-Python-tool",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4dcdac3fe7a75ea",
      "translationZh": "很希望听到每天都运行这类东西的人的反馈，尤其是关于回退启发式策略的意见。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd2c2a89c1c13fd9",
      "translationZh": "你希望它在哪些方面做得不一样？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bc1aba408e7d3c3",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/simrankoulsm 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "OOMs",
